OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome showers
OL,6,Flingering along coastlines, but
OL,7,Fgenerally dry. Temperatures will fall
OL,8,Fto become a cold night, under
OL,9,Fincreasingly clear spells. Areas of
OL,10,Ffog developing later, most likely away
OL,11,Ffrom Cornish peninsula, and patchy
OL,12,Ffrost possible.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAny areas of fog will lift
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. From then, a dry
OL,16,Fbut mostly cloudy day is expected,
OL,17,Fwith the occasional break to sunny
OL,18,Fskies. Another chilly autumn day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
