OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA foggy
OL,6,Fand frosty morning for Sunday, then
OL,7,Fbecoming a clear, crisp autumn day.
OL,8,FIncreasingly milder and windy with
OL,9,Flight rain Monday, then some heavier
OL,10,Fbursts push in by Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
